Package: normalizedMoran
Title: Normalized Moran's I index by Tillé et al. (2026)
Version: 0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Diego", "Giuliani", , "diego.giuliani@unitn.it", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Functions to compute the "I_6" normalized version of the global Moran's I index proposed by Tillé et al. (2026) <doi:10.1111/insr.70067> and perform the associated spatial autocorrelation tests both under normalization and Monte Carlo random permutation. 
